divergence.broiler-js: row U3: U+A7CE against U+A7CF under i without u, as a character and in a class; Broiler.JS answers false: .NET's casing data under IgnoreCase predates U+A7CE, where Unicode 17.0.0's toUppercase makes both U+A7CE; a correction of Broiler.JS by data decision (JSD-0081; class C5, SJL-D-6 (c)); answered by SJL-11.5, Broiler.JS's cut-over to Broiler.Regex
